cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenRelTime Studio, cite the software below and the OpenRelTime engine it drives."
title: "OpenRelTime Studio: a bilingual desktop GUI for relative-rate molecular dating"
abstract: >-
  Native PySide6 desktop front end for the OpenRelTime relative-rate framework.
  Provides RRF rate and time inference, interactive tree-based calibration,
  confidence intervals, CorrTest rate-autocorrelation testing and a ddBD
  diversification prior, with export of results and equivalent command-line
  scripts. The interface switches live between English and Simplified Chinese
  and between light and dark themes.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "曾子超"
    email: "zengzichao@sjtu.edu.cn"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6553-970X"
  - name: "王寅炤"
    email: "wyz@sjtu.edu.cn"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8715-1386"
version: "0.1.1"
# The Studio's Zenodo *concept* DOI.  It is version-agnostic and resolves today,
# so it is the only DOI that is true for 0.1.1 right now.  The DOI it used to
# carry here, 10.5281/zenodo.23053175, is the v0.1.0 *version* record and must
# not be paired with 0.1.1.  When 0.1.1 is tagged and released, Zenodo mints a
# new version record under this concept DOI; swap `doi` for that record's DOI
# and set `date-released` to its publication date at the same commit (see the
# release checklist in CONTRIBUTING.md).  Nothing has been published from here.
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23053174"
date-released: "2026-10-08"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
funding: >-
  This work was supported by the National Natural Science Foundation of China
  [grant numbers 42422209, 42272354] and the National Key Research and
  Development Program of China [grant number 2023YFC3108600].
repository-code: "https://github.com/ZengZichao/OpenRelTime-Studio"
url: "https://github.com/ZengZichao/OpenRelTime-Studio"
keywords:
  - molecular dating
  - phylogenetics
  - relative rate framework
  - timetree
  - desktop GUI
  - PySide6
requires:
  - name: "openreltime"
    version: ">=0.1.0"
    type: software
    repository-code: "https://github.com/ZengZichao/OpenRelTime"
